<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank two-week rev repo ave yield 18.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank two-week rev repo ave yield 18.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in the Czech National Bank's (CNB) two-week reverse repo tender to drain market liquidity dipped to 18.19 percent, down from 18.5 percent in a similar operation last week.</p>
<p>The CNB added in a statement that all bids at the maximum rate of 18.2 percent were satisfied.</p>
</text>
